{"id":"39648aefc44f4243","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-elliptic-modularity-data.md","title":"Integral Weierstrass Models and Arithmetic Modularity","display":"df-elliptic-modularity-data — Integral Weierstrass Models and Arithmetic Modularity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elliptic-modularity-data","aliases":["58-df-elliptic-modularity-data"],"display":"df-elliptic-modularity-data — Integral Weierstrass Models and Arithmetic Modularity","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elliptic-modularity-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elliptic-modularity-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elliptic-modularity-data — Integral Weierstrass Models and Arithmetic Modularity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md\">../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a891b0f45131631a\" href=\"?note=a891b0f45131631a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md\">../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,k,O,K_E,A,B,a,a&#39;,b,f,N,p,u,r,s,t\\in V\">\\(E,k,O,K_E,A,B,a,a&#39;,b,f,N,p,u,r,s,t\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb Z,\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb Z,\\mathbb C\\)</span> 使用本书的通常算术结构及其标准嵌入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q}\">\\(+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q}\\)</span> 是这两个二元运算的函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\{1,2,3,4,6\\}\">\\(J=\\{1,2,3,4,6\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i=a(i)\">\\(a_i=a(i)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\mid n\">\\(m\\mid n\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(n=mq)\">\\(\\exists q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(n=mq)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#S\">\\(\\#S\\)</span> 用于有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的自然数基数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:\\operatorname{Im}z&gt;0\\}\">\\(\\mathcal H=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:\\operatorname{Im}z&gt;0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_2\">\\(I_2\\)</span> 为二阶单位矩阵；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>、矩阵的分式线性作用及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S,\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S,\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S\\)</span> 取依赖文件的同一约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_2,b_4,b_6,b_8,\\Delta\">\\(b_2,b_4,b_6,b_8,\\Delta\\)</span> 的定义域都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z^J\">\\(\\mathbb Z^J\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_p(a),A_p(a),\\chi_p(a)\">\\(N_p(a),A_p(a),\\chi_p(a)\\)</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为下式的素数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\\)</span> 在此给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\mathbb Q\">\\(k=\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 的接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_E\">\\(K_E\\)</span> 是六分量短 Weierstrass 方程呈示，不是函数域。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md\">../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}\">\\(\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RationalPrime}\">\\(\\mathrm{RationalPrime}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\leftrightarrow\np\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq p\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(d\\mid p\\to(d=1\\lor d=p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\leftrightarrow\np\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq p\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(d\\mid p\\to(d=1\\lor d=p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nk=\\mathbb Q\\land A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\land K_E=\\langle+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0,1,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists O\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nk=\\mathbb Q\\land A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\land K_E=\\langle+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0,1,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists O\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\land4A^3+27B^2\\ne0\\land a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists u\\in\\mathbb Q\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists r,s,t\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\nua_1=2s\\land u^2a_2=3r-s^2\\land u^3a_3=2t\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land u^4a_4=3r^2+A-2st\n\\land u^6a_6=r^3+Ar+B-t^2\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\land4A^3+27B^2\\ne0\\land a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists u\\in\\mathbb Q\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists r,s,t\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\nua_1=2s\\land u^2a_2=3r-s^2\\land u^3a_3=2t\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land u^4a_4=3r^2+A-2st\n\\land u^6a_6=r^3+Ar+B-t^2\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\ \\to\\quad\nb_2(a)&amp;\\coloneqq a_1^2+4a_2, &amp; b_4(a)&amp;\\coloneqq a_1a_3+2a_4,\\\\\nb_6(a)&amp;\\coloneqq a_3^2+4a_6, &amp; b_8(a)&amp;\\coloneqq a_1^2a_6+4a_2a_6-a_1a_3a_4+a_2a_3^2-a_4^2,\\\\\n\\Delta(a)&amp;\\coloneqq-b_2(a)^2b_8(a)-8b_4(a)^3-27b_6(a)^2+9b_2(a)b_4(a)b_6(a).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\ \\to\\quad\nb_2(a)&amp;\\coloneqq a_1^2+4a_2, &amp; b_4(a)&amp;\\coloneqq a_1a_3+2a_4,\\\\\nb_6(a)&amp;\\coloneqq a_3^2+4a_6, &amp; b_8(a)&amp;\\coloneqq a_1^2a_6+4a_2a_6-a_1a_3a_4+a_2a_3^2-a_4^2,\\\\\n\\Delta(a)&amp;\\coloneqq-b_2(a)^2b_8(a)-8b_4(a)^3-27b_6(a)^2+9b_2(a)b_4(a)b_6(a).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\land\\Delta(a)\\ne0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a&#39;,A,B)\\to\\Delta(a)\\mid\\Delta(a&#39;)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\land\\Delta(a)\\ne0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a&#39;\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a&#39;,A,B)\\to\\Delta(a)\\mid\\Delta(a&#39;)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\land\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\ \\to\\quad\nN_p(a)&amp;\\coloneqq 1+\\#\\bigl\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in p\\times p:\np\\mid y^2+a_1xy+a_3y-x^3-a_2x^2-a_4x-a_6\\bigr\\},\\\\\nA_p(a)&amp;\\coloneqq p+1-N_p(a),\\\\\n\\chi_p(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;p\\mid\\Delta(a),\\\\1,&amp;p\\nmid\\Delta(a).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\land\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\ \\to\\quad\nN_p(a)&amp;\\coloneqq 1+\\#\\bigl\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in p\\times p:\np\\mid y^2+a_1xy+a_3y-x^3-a_2x^2-a_4x-a_6\\bigr\\},\\\\\nA_p(a)&amp;\\coloneqq p+1-N_p(a),\\\\\n\\chi_p(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&amp;p\\mid\\Delta(a),\\\\1,&amp;p\\nmid\\Delta(a).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\land p\\mid\\Delta(a))\\to A_p(a)\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\land p\\mid\\Delta(a))\\to A_p(a)\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}_{58}(b,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\land\\Delta(a)\\ne0\\land b\\in\\mathbb Z^\\omega\\land b(0)=0\\land b(1)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\to b(mn)=b(m)b(n))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\to\n\\bigl[b(p)=A_p(a)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{23mm}\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\nb(p^{j+1})=A_p(a)b(p^j)-\\chi_p(a)p\\,b(p^{j-1})\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}_{58}(b,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\land\\Delta(a)\\ne0\\land b\\in\\mathbb Z^\\omega\\land b(0)=0\\land b(1)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\to b(mn)=b(m)b(n))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\to\n\\bigl[b(p)=A_p(a)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{23mm}\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\nb(p^{j+1})=A_p(a)b(p^j)-\\chi_p(a)p\\,b(p^{j-1})\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\ \\to\\quad\n\\Gamma_0(N)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{pmatrix}r&amp;s\\\\t&amp;u\\end{pmatrix}\\in M_2(\\mathbb Z):ru-st=1\\land N\\mid t\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\ \\to\\quad\n\\Gamma_0(N)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{pmatrix}r&amp;s\\\\t&amp;u\\end{pmatrix}\\in M_2(\\mathbb Z):ru-st=1\\land N\\mid t\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb Z^\\omega\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\land\n\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}_{58}(b,a)\n\\land\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S(f,2,\\Gamma_0(N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(b,f,2,\\infty,I_2,1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb Z^\\omega\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\land\n\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}_{58}(b,a)\n\\land\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S(f,2,\\Gamma_0(N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(b,f,2,\\infty,I_2,1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>整系数方程由实际有理坐标变换构造；极小性用判别式对全部整模型的整除关系表达。有限域点数同时用于好约化和极小奇异模型的局部系数，因而不把未构造的 Néron 模型、约化类型、导子或 Hecke 算子作为原语。模性由全部 Euler 递推系数的尖点形式实现表达；不只匹配一个任意选取的素数子集。旧三元接口及上游六分量方程呈示均保留。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<p>Andrew V. Sutherland, 18.783 Elliptic Curves, Spring 2022, Lecture 24, §§24.6–24.8（极小模型、局部系数、半稳定性及模性的算术表述）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md","status":"resolved","id":"a891b0f45131631a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-modular-form.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}$ 取 [[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,k,O,K_E,A,B,a,a',b,f,N,p,u,r,s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb Z,\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q}","display":false},{"tex":"J=\\{1,2,3,4,6\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb Z^J","display":false},{"tex":"a_i=a(i)","display":false},{"tex":"m\\mid n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists q\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(n=mq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\#S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H=\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:\\operatorname{Im}z>0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S,\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"b_2,b_4,b_6,b_8,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z^J","display":false},{"tex":"N_p(a),A_p(a),\\chi_p(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb Z^J","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)","display":false},{"tex":"k=\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"K_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RationalPrime}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\leftrightarrow\np\\in\\omega\\land2\\leq p\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;(d\\mid p\\to(d=1\\lor d=p)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nk=\\mathbb Q\\land A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\land K_E=\\langle+_{\\mathbb Q},\\cdot_{\\mathbb Q},0,1,A,B\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\exists O\\in V\\;\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\land4A^3+27B^2\\ne0\\land a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\\\\n&\\land\\exists u\\in\\mathbb Q\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists r,s,t\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\Bigl(\nua_1=2s\\land u^2a_2=3r-s^2\\land u^3a_3=2t\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}\\land u^4a_4=3r^2+A-2st\n\\land u^6a_6=r^3+Ar+B-t^2\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\ \\to\\quad\nb_2(a)&\\coloneqq a_1^2+4a_2, & b_4(a)&\\coloneqq a_1a_3+2a_4,\\\\\nb_6(a)&\\coloneqq a_3^2+4a_6, & b_8(a)&\\coloneqq a_1^2a_6+4a_2a_6-a_1a_3a_4+a_2a_3^2-a_4^2,\\\\\n\\Delta(a)&\\coloneqq-b_2(a)^2b_8(a)-8b_4(a)^3-27b_6(a)^2+9b_2(a)b_4(a)b_6(a).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\land\\Delta(a)\\ne0\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a'\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IntegralWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a',A,B)\\to\\Delta(a)\\mid\\Delta(a')\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\land\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\ \\to\\quad\nN_p(a)&\\coloneqq 1+\\#\\bigl\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in p\\times p:\np\\mid y^2+a_1xy+a_3y-x^3-a_2x^2-a_4x-a_6\\bigr\\},\\\\\nA_p(a)&\\coloneqq p+1-N_p(a),\\\\\n\\chi_p(a)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0,&p\\mid\\Delta(a),\\\\1,&p\\nmid\\Delta(a).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Semistable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl((\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\land p\\mid\\Delta(a))\\to A_p(a)\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}_{58}(b,a)\\leftrightarrow{}&\na\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\land\\Delta(a)\\ne0\\land b\\in\\mathbb Z^\\omega\\land b(0)=0\\land b(1)=1\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl[\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\n(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\to b(mn)=b(m)b(n))\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{RationalPrime}_{58}(p)\\to\n\\bigl[b(p)=A_p(a)\\\\\n&\\hspace{23mm}\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\nb(p^{j+1})=A_p(a)b(p^j)-\\chi_p(a)p\\,b(p^{j-1})\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\ \\to\\quad\n\\Gamma_0(N)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{pmatrix}r&s\\\\t&u\\end{pmatrix}\\in M_2(\\mathbb Z):ru-st=1\\land N\\mid t\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModularEllipticCurve}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(E,k,K_E)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb Z^J\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathbb Z^\\omega\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\mathrm{RationalEllipticPresentation}_{58}(E,k,K_E,A,B)\\land\n\\mathrm{MinimalWeierstrassModel}_{58}(a,A,B)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{EllipticSeriesCoefficients}_{58}(b,a)\n\\land\\mathrm{CuspForm}_S(f,2,\\Gamma_0(N))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{CuspExpansion}_S(b,f,2,\\infty,I_2,1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":5708,"backlinks":[{"id":"e419ede20b7ef468","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-475","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-elliptic-modularity-data.md|58-df-elliptic-modularity-data]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["74f4744df7db749f","a891b0f45131631a"]}